 gold this is what i mean when i suggest  that radagon is attempting to mend his  relationships with his children they  were both born of afflictions nicola  born of eternal youth and melania  harboring the scarlet rot since birth  were they born with these afflictions  because ratagon and america are the same  person some kind of incest birth defect  of some kind it's really hard to  pinpoint this obviously these  incantations gifted from ratagon  temicola could have been an attempt at  helping mikola find a cure for melania's  scarlet rot and when mikala found that  fundamentalism couldn't help her he  abandoned it all together and just moved  on mikala also created the hail tree to  help the albanorics in the misbegotten  find refuge from those who wish to  destroy them this is the only reason i  can think of as to why we find a  misbegotten crusader in the foreign cave  of the consecrated snow fields wielding  the golden order greatsword the  description of the sword reads  greatsword made of light modeled after  the elden ring itself forged by king  consort ratagon to proudly symbolize the  tenets of the golden order telltale  signs betray that this was once the  great sword bequeathed to him by his  first wife ranala this sword could have  been given to this misbegotten by  ratagon or mykola because of mykola's  intent to save the misbegotten people it  was a chance for radagon to help his son  in his attempts to do so while also  spreading the influence of the golden  order to other factions to portray peace  and forgiveness just like he did with  ranala in the carrion royals or this  misbegotten just found the sword we  really can't say this is all quite a  stretch i'm sure so make sure to tell me  what you think down in the comments  there's a lot here and it's easy to  think of these situations through  completely different perspectives all of  which i'm sure is entirely plausible in  the end i believe ratagon didn't have a  choice to fight against us when we  entered the earth tree it's hard to say  how much damage the shattering of the  elden ring did to both ratagon and  america's mind and body to me they look  completely broken and are barely held  together when ratagon fights us it looks  like he's being used like a puppet by  the greater will and once we defeat him  a manifestation of the greater will the  elden beast literally uses radagon yet  again to become the be sword known as  the sacred relic sword which reads as a  sword wrought with the remains of a god  who should have lived a life eternal  thoughts on what the weapon pretends are  many and varied some consider it the  mark of a great sin or a sign of great  devastation some think of it as the end  of an age while others the beginning  just like with most of the story with  elden ring it can mean many different  things to many different people to me  ratagon wanted to show america and  himself that it was possible to change  without the need for the destruction of  the golden order that the laws can be  changed and that forgiveness for past  sins can be earned when there's an  attempt by both sides to do so i believe  he genuinely loved ranala and he found  that it was impossible for him not to  return to the golden order ratagon in  ranala's relationship was built entirely  on the foundation of the church of vows  where he swore his love for her he  repented his past and cleansed himself  to seek forgiveness in the end it didn't  seem to work ratagon returned to the  urgery and this completely destroyed  ranala's heart my next planned video is  actually on ranala and so far it's  turned out to be  much more heartbreaking than i  originally thought ratagan's return also  confirmed with merica that the elden  ring needed to be destroyed as it seemed  like it was truly impossible to change  however muriel's faith in ratagon's will  to change has never wavered i'll leave  you all today with his wise words that i  think truly explain what ratagon was  trying to achieve  the shattering has caused us  all of us to lose sight of something  very dear  my faith does not waver  the miracle rooted in these grounds  will once again mend the world  and this time  its bounty will not be squandered  if you would be elden lord  tarnished  i hope that you too will share my faith  [Music]  you
 

